  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"rVwkY\" id=\"rVwkY\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4dcbd7e6\" id=\"u4dcbd7e6\">服务管家与软件打包</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u9ed7c20b\" id=\"u9ed7c20b\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uee4ab064\" id=\"uee4ab064\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">第 1 节课：机器人的“出厂记忆”（启动流程降维认知）</span></strong></p><ul list=\"u3e50d871\"><li fid=\"u8c82d431\" data-lake-id=\"u5cbfa19d\" id=\"u5cbfa19d\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uaa1f380c\" id=\"uaa1f380c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">痛点引入：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u874d1983\" id=\"u874d1983\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> 昨天我们让屏幕亮了，但断电重启后，一切归零。难道机器人每次开机都要人工敲命令？</span></li><li fid=\"u8c82d431\" data-lake-id=\"u101aa1d9\" id=\"u101aa1d9\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0c533467\" id=\"u0c533467\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">野路子 vs 正规军：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7c483cd9\" id=\"u7c483cd9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">网上很多教程教你改 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ua94a620b\" id=\"ua94a620b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u46d650b5\" id=\"u46d650b5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">/etc/rc.local</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u31a46e38\" id=\"u31a46e38\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">，这就像是在 Windows 的注册表里乱改，容易崩。真实的工业产品，用的是 OpenWrt 标准的</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u88c4c66d\" id=\"u88c4c66d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">“服务管家 (init.d)”</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue0280d0b\" id=\"ue0280d0b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">和</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9e8f119d\" id=\"u9e8f119d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">“软件包打包系统”</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u013e36bf\" id=\"u013e36bf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">。我们要把点亮屏幕的代码，像正规软件一样“安装”进系统底层。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"ucbb90671\" id=\"ucbb90671\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1ef6a214\" id=\"u1ef6a214\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">第 2 节课：第一重考验 —— 迷宫寻宝与目录搭建</span></strong></p><ul list=\"u04815bfe\"><li fid=\"u49aacab3\" data-lake-id=\"u3ed74efe\" id=\"u3ed74efe\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub4ccf2f9\" id=\"ub4ccf2f9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">避坑预警（路径陷阱）：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf0296c3a\" id=\"uf0296c3a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> 很多新手死在第一步，找不到往哪里放代码。不要被外层迷惑，我们要直捣黄龙，进入</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1d5c10de\" id=\"u1d5c10de\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">核心层的 package 目录</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0c535156\" id=\"u0c535156\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u3bb5db04\" id=\"u3bb5db04\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ueecfa1ce\" id=\"ueecfa1ce\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">实操动作：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u381eedf4\" id=\"u381eedf4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> 在 Ubuntu 终端里敲下命令，建立标准目录结构。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22cd%20~%2FT113-Tina5.0-V1.2%2Fopenwrt%2Fopenwrt%2Fpackage%20%20%23%20%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%9A%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%A4%E5%B1%82%20openwrt%EF%BC%81%5Cnmkdir%20-p%20oled-hello%2Ffiles%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aAVe8%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ul list=\"u04815bfe\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u49aacab3\" data-lake-id=\"u77d267f5\" id=\"u77d267f5\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8c8abb52\" id=\"u8c8abb52\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">建立框架：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua8ff565c\" id=\"ua8ff565c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> 我们现在就相当于在开发一款名为 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u20fc1dac\" id=\"u20fc1dac\"><span data-lake-id=\"u970f0d99\" id=\"u970f0d99\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">oled-hello</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u5119cffb\" id=\"u5119cffb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> 的官方插件！</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u545a2162\" id=\"u545a2162\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufd7cfce4\" id=\"ufd7cfce4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">第 3 节课：填表与造物（Makefile 与业务脚本）</span></strong></p><ul list=\"ub9d86d4a\"><li fid=\"u552cabac\" data-lake-id=\"u7dd6a229\" id=\"u7dd6a229\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ucf36fabf\" id=\"ucf36fabf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">核心动作 1：造蓝图（Makefile）</span></strong></li></ul><ul list=\"ub9d86d4a\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u10e5449b\" data-lake-id=\"u60526cd1\" id=\"u60526cd1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u405ed845\" id=\"u405ed845\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">这是告诉系统“怎么打包”的说明书。用 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u1c66c106\" id=\"u1c66c106\"><span data-lake-id=\"u56222c82\" id=\"u56222c82\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">vi oled-hello/Makefile</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u38aad31b\" id=\"u38aad31b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> 敲入代码。</span></li><li fid=\"u10e5449b\" data-lake-id=\"u26bc1840\" id=\"u26bc1840\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ucf4ca759\" id=\"ucf4ca759\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">⚠️</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4d4b551b\" id=\"u4d4b551b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> 致命细节警告：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u37423118\" id=\"u37423118\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> 重点强调第 9 行 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ub394e2f9\" id=\"ub394e2f9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9b1b2c83\" id=\"u9b1b2c83\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">include $(INCLUDE_DIR)/package.mk</span></code></li><li fid=\"u10e5449b\" data-lake-id=\"ud80244bb\" id=\"ud80244bb\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufd957e4b\" id=\"ufd957e4b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">并且 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u660bea1a\" id=\"u660bea1a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u89e6cb3e\" id=\"u89e6cb3e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">define Package...</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ucbeefcbc\" id=\"ucbeefcbc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> 里面的缩进</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6eda6c68\" id=\"u6eda6c68\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">绝对不能用空格，必须用 Tab 键！</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u48a70d5d\" id=\"u48a70d5d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">（这是无数老手都会翻车的天坑）。</span></li></ul><ul list=\"ub9d86d4a\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u552cabac\" data-lake-id=\"u77d0ae20\" id=\"u77d0ae20\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub931f4c2\" id=\"ub931f4c2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">核心动作 2：注入灵魂（oled_hello.sh）</span></strong></li></ul><ul list=\"ub9d86d4a\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"ub8a3ab84\" data-lake-id=\"u4b7e14b8\" id=\"u4b7e14b8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9e73b5da\" id=\"u9e73b5da\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">在 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ue78a0cbd\" id=\"ue78a0cbd\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc38d6a90\" id=\"uc38d6a90\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">files</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u9bf756b4\" id=\"u9bf756b4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> 目录下创建具体干活的脚本。把昨天那段能让屏幕显示 HELLO 的极简脚本贴进去。</span></li><li fid=\"ub8a3ab84\" data-lake-id=\"u038cff62\" id=\"u038cff62\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u33a2fadf\" id=\"u33a2fadf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">⚠️</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u031b52fe\" id=\"u031b52fe\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> 细节警告：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0355666b\" id=\"u0355666b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> Linux 极其严谨。在这里循环不能用 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u6dc278b8\" id=\"u6dc278b8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u803deab7\" id=\"u803deab7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">{1..64}</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ueccc8587\" id=\"ueccc8587\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">，必须用 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u1a4a742f\" id=\"u1a4a742f\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua96f6889\" id=\"ua96f6889\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">$(seq 1 64)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u949dc237\" id=\"u949dc237\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">，因为系统底层的 shell (ash) 极其精简，不支持花里胡哨的语法。</span></li></ul><ul list=\"ub9d86d4a\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"u552cabac\" data-lake-id=\"u31e40a1f\" id=\"u31e40a1f\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5d9e13e5\" id=\"u5d9e13e5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">核心动作 3：呼叫管家（oled.init 启动脚本）</span></strong></li></ul><ul list=\"ub9d86d4a\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u0a14ac08\" data-lake-id=\"u063727e9\" id=\"u063727e9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4f40a72c\" id=\"u4f40a72c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">这是开机自启的关键。创建一个 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uc7237f29\" id=\"uc7237f29\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua1e8ecda\" id=\"ua1e8ecda\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">/etc/rc.common</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u126c4049\" id=\"u126c4049\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> 标准的启动脚本。</span></li><li fid=\"u0a14ac08\" data-lake-id=\"u67327b61\" id=\"u67327b61\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ueb80e004\" id=\"ueb80e004\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">⚠️</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u02cfcc07\" id=\"u02cfcc07\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> 细节警告：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u211c8922\" id=\"u211c8922\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> 强调 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u514c2459\" id=\"u514c2459\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud6eb6d11\" id=\"ud6eb6d11\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">START=99</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"udaa1b661\" id=\"udaa1b661\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">。系统有很多初始化工作，99 代表最后执行。“一定要等 IIC 驱动这些路都铺好了，我们再出门，不然会摔死”。</span></li><li fid=\"u0a14ac08\" data-lake-id=\"u728d26a9\" id=\"u728d26a9\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uafccc714\" id=\"uafccc714\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">神级符号 </span></strong><code data-lake-id=\"ua874bdd4\" id=\"ua874bdd4\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u223f56ee\" id=\"u223f56ee\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">&amp;</span></strong></code><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ueb071a59\" id=\"ueb071a59\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">：</span></strong><code data-lake-id=\"u5c5a4a7a\" id=\"u5c5a4a7a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u419c3b5f\" id=\"u419c3b5f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">/usr/bin/oled_hello.sh &amp;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub5cba82e\" id=\"ub5cba82e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">。告诉学生，加个 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u51598e8e\" id=\"u51598e8e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u013fef3f\" id=\"u013fef3f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">&amp;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u10469023\" id=\"u10469023\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> 让它在后台跑，绝不能阻塞系统的正常启动！</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id=\"xZAJe\" id=\"xZAJe\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud1a404c2\" id=\"ud1a404c2\">操作流程</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"PLv6u\" id=\"PLv6u\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub3afe56e\" id=\"ub3afe56e\" style=\"color: rgb(43, 45, 49)\"> 预期的目录结构</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ube2a97b6\" id=\"ube2a97b6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufda12963\" id=\"ufda12963\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">在</span><code data-lake-id=\"u95e91518\" id=\"u95e91518\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9f03eb35\" id=\"u9f03eb35\">openwrt/openwrt/package/oled-hello </span></code><span data-lake-id=\"udc9becf1\" id=\"udc9becf1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(43, 45, 49); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">目录下创建如下文件目录结构</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22oled-hello%2F%5Cn%E2%94%9C%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%20Makefile%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%23%20%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%5Cn%E2%94%94%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%20files%2F%5Cn%20%20%20%20%E2%94%9C%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%20oled.init%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E8%87%AA%E5%90%AF%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E8%84%9A%E6%9C%AC%5Cn%20%20%20%20%E2%94%94%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%20oled_hello.sh%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%23%20%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E8%84%9A%E6%9C%AC%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mUnp4%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u8b20bf13\" id=\"u