"ub6d2c4a1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">make menuconfig</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub0af0b01\" id=\"ub0af0b01\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">。在 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ude062aeb\" id=\"ude062aeb\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub1f481c7\" id=\"ub1f481c7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">Utilities</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u8fd79d62\" id=\"u8fd79d62\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> 里找到我们亲手写的 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u09982683\" id=\"u09982683\"><span data-lake-id=\"u359149ea\" id=\"u359149ea\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">oled-hello</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u61c8ebe6\" id=\"u61c8ebe6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">！</span></li><li fid=\"ua70b82f2\" data-lake-id=\"u271aa7c1\" id=\"u271aa7c1\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue1c9491a\" id=\"ue1c9491a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">按下 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u64f87c38\" id=\"u64f87c38\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf4fc60c2\" id=\"uf4fc60c2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">Y</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u104db651\" id=\"u104db651\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> 键，让前面的括号变成 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ub4a1ed32\" id=\"ub4a1ed32\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue3c8307d\" id=\"ue3c8307d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">[*]</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf59a8a44\" id=\"uf59a8a44\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">（星号代表：作为独立插件，直接死死地焊在系统镜像里！）。保存退出。</span></li></ul><ul list=\"ud2dc5388\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u15837449\" data-lake-id=\"ud6708f97\" id=\"ud6708f97\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u64d65889\" id=\"u64d65889\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">实操 3：一键出炉</span></strong></li></ul><ul list=\"ud2dc5388\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u6f572f3a\" data-lake-id=\"uc21cfe8c\" id=\"uc21cfe8c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u00fbcc76\" id=\"u00fbcc76\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">先教大家验证单包编译（非常专业的排错手法）：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u5b6a136b\" id=\"u5b6a136b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7fbeed9c\" id=\"u7fbeed9c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">make package/oled-hello/compile V=s</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u5254d43a\" id=\"u5254d43a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">。没有 Error 就是胜利！</span></li><li fid=\"u6f572f3a\" data-lake-id=\"u2954686c\" id=\"u2954686c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u19ae4a13\" id=\"u19ae4a13\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">最后，在根目录敲下 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uc701b393\" id=\"uc701b393\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6a72b154\" id=\"u6a72b154\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">make -j8</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf135421b\" id=\"uf135421b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> 和 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u64539dc4\" id=\"u64539dc4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6b20e498\" id=\"u6b20e498\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">pack</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u2a15ef82\" id=\"u2a15ef82\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u9923edd9\" id=\"u9923edd9\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubee2bc88\" id=\"ubee2bc88\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">第 6 节课：脱缰的野马，独立的灵魂（终极验证）</span></strong></p><ul list=\"uaf9ebf0a\"><li fid=\"u6e243af9\" data-lake-id=\"u44835a46\" id=\"u44835a46\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf100e7a9\" id=\"uf100e7a9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">高光时刻：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"udbc5a18b\" id=\"udbc5a18b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> 拿着刚刚打包出炉的 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u91178e23\" id=\"u91178e23\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6738d391\" id=\"u6738d391\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">.img</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u6a82732b\" id=\"u6a82732b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> 文件，用 PhoenixSuit 烧录到 T113 开发板里。</span></li><li fid=\"u6e243af9\" data-lake-id=\"u0c65a2b7\" id=\"u0c65a2b7\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua479e921\" id=\"ua479e921\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">拔掉数据线：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue91c6728\" id=\"ue91c6728\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> 让所有学生拔掉连接电脑的串口线、调试线。只拿一根普通的 Type-C 充电线（或充电宝）插在板子上。</span></li><li fid=\"u6e243af9\" data-lake-id=\"ubc2aa3a2\" id=\"ubc2aa3a2\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua1e07c14\" id=\"ua1e07c14\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">见证奇迹：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u25dd0aad\" id=\"u25dd0aad\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> 板子上电。十几秒的盲等之后，不需要敲击任何键盘，也不需要连接任何网络。那块小巧的 OLED 屏幕突然“唰”地一下亮起，居中显示出清晰的 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uce44f03f\" id=\"uce44f03f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">HELLO</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud5abc41e\" id=\"ud5abc41e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">！</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u639d8146\" id=\"u639d8146\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u13bf6cd3\" id=\"u13bf6cd3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">排错预案教学：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4c7d4c43\" id=\"u4c7d4c43\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> 万一没亮怎么办？插回串口线，如何去系统里排查管家进程：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22ls%20%2Fetc%2Frc.d%2FS99oled%20%20%20%20%20%20%23%20%E6%A3%80%E6%9F%A5%E8%87%AA%E5%90%AF%E8%BD%AF%E9%93%BE%E6%8E%A5%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%8D%E5%9C%A8%5Cn%2Fetc%2Finit.d%2Foled%20start%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%B0%9D%E8%AF%95%E6%89%8B%E5%8A%A8%E8%A7%A6%E5%8F%91%E7%AE%A1%E5%AE%B6%EF%BC%8C%E7%9C%8B%E5%93%AA%E9%87%8C%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lqtC5%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22dJwRU%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"581a4b5a\" id=\"581a4b5a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub2a5dc75\" id=\"ub2a5dc75\">🚀</span><span data-lake-id=\"u8c7f7ede\" id=\"u8c7f7ede\"> 课程升华</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u271ba32e\" id=\"u271ba32e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1b9ed83d\" id=\"u1b9ed83d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">“同学们，今天屏幕上亮起的这句 HELLO，和我们昨天敲命令亮起的 HELLO，有着本质的区别。 昨天的它，是个受你摆布的提线木偶；而今天的它，</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufbc989c9\" id=\"ufbc989c9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">已经具备了出厂即运行的独立生命！</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud53b2fc6\" id=\"ud53b2fc6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> 大疆的无人机开机会自动响铃预检，智能音箱插电会自动说‘你好’，靠的全部都是你们今天亲手走通的这套 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u276f1754\" id=\"u276f1754\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">OpenWrt 工业级标准打包与服务守护流程</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u029de2b7\" id=\"u029de2b7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub22ce517\" id=\"ub22ce517\"><span data-lake-id=\"u942b550b\" id=\"u942b550b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">你们今天完成的，不仅是一个小实验，而是真正走完了一个 Linux 驱动软件工程师从写代码、做系统包、到底层打包量产的</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud56b3e03\" id=\"ud56b3e03\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">全生命周期闭环</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ucfa2df52\" id=\"ucfa2df52\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">！”</span></p>",
